[] 0 setdash 0 0 336 280 rectstroke
% layer: Guides
0.627 0.353 0.863 setrgbcolor
[6 4] 0 setdash newpath 168 280 moveto 168 0 lineto stroke
0.627 0.353 0.863 setrgbcolor
[6 4] 0 setdash newpath 0 140 moveto 336 140 lineto stroke
grestore
showpage
%%EOF
